+Operations Playbook: Production Rollout (Milvus, Verifier, Kernel, Rater, Telemetry, Spot)
+
+Summary (high level steps)
+1. Milvus:
+   - Customize ops/milvus/values_prod_tls.yaml with real TLS cert secret name milvus-tls and storage class.
+   - Create Kubernetes secret milvus-tls with TLS cert/key (ops/milvus/milvus-tls-secret-template.yaml).
+   - Run: ./ops/milvus/prod_deploy.sh milvus milvus-prod ops/milvus/values_prod_tls.yaml
+   - Confirm MILVUS_URI secret exists and applications can read it.
+
+2. KMS / Cosign / Kyverno:
+   - Run: ./ops/kms/create_kms_cosign_and_iam.sh alias/aegis-cosign
+   - Add created KMS ARN to CI secret COSIGN_AWS_KMS_KEY_ARN.
+   - Deploy Kyverno policy (security/kyverno/require-signed-images-kms.yaml) and replace with a proper admission webhook that calls cosign verify in prod.
+
+3. GPU Runners:
+   - Provision GPU hosts and run ./ops/ci/register_self_hosted_runner.sh your-org/your-repo
+   - Label runner with 'gpu' for kernel CI jobs.
+
+4. Build & iterate ternary kernel:
+   - On GPU host run: ./ops/sustainability/ternary_kernel_build/compile_and_test.sh
+   - Use .github/workflows/build_ternary_kernel_gpu.yml to run CI for kernel builds.
+   - Iterate optimizations in ops/triton/backend/ternary_gemm_stream.cu and measure with bench_runner.
+
